$MDESC::Type = "CTF_S_hift";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Deus Sanguinius" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear & Hazey" @
         "\n<f1>Visibility: <f0> Very far" @
	 "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> fight to defend their Dish network of Deus Sanguinius. Destroying eachothers base means no T.V for the mothership! We can't have that. Each team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base, touching it to their own flag to capture.  The first team with ten captures shall be the victor!";
